      "text": "This is a **headed / borrowed-connection backend**, **not headless**. Routine background actions do not bring Chrome forward or create windows. Missing normal windows return `CHROME_NORMAL_WINDOW_REQUIRED`. Automated DOM/screenshot regression and anonymous isolation require a separately owned Chromium headless shell."
