    {
      "section": "Boundaries and maintenance",
      "text": "`openCaptureSession` creates a dedicated owner/target. Closing freezes new work, interrupts owned in-flight operations and awaits actual Chrome Promise/create settlement. Unconfirmed cleanup retains the owner as `CHROME_CLEANUP_PENDING`; explicit close can retry. Timeout, disconnection or a new worker's empty ledger is not proof of cleanup. Create settlement and close ACK each wait up to 3 seconds. Unknown worker generation remains a typed retained unknown. This is not a durable cross-Host-crash transaction; hard-worker-crash acceptance remains separate."
    },
